{"name": "Crown's Trial", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crown's Trial</strong> is a Souls-Like Boss Rush where each battle takes place in a different realm. Master the tight combat mechanics to defeat legendary heroes inspired from various historical eras like Ancient Rome, Feudal Japan, and The Crusades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>History's Greatest Warriors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunge into a fantasy world where legendary figures from across time await your challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"502\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/b98418272f0a96f5a54d43a392ef27d2.poster.avif?t=1783685881\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/b98418272f0a96f5a54d43a392ef27d2.webm?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/b98418272f0a96f5a54d43a392ef27d2.mp4?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Freedom to Choose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a stunning, <strong>non-linear</strong> experience that gives you total freedom. Decide which legendary enemy falls first. The order is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"502\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/d59b682a9c9dccfa8d6ef8077467324c.poster.avif?t=1783685881\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/d59b682a9c9dccfa8d6ef8077467324c.webm?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/d59b682a9c9dccfa8d6ef8077467324c.mp4?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter each fight with a unique load-out and abilities, as well as it's own core mechanic that you'll need to master to triumph. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"502\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/a06588a6d58e28b54b6e3e08c9873180.poster.avif?t=1783685881\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/a06588a6d58e28b54b6e3e08c9873180.webm?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/a06588a6d58e28b54b6e3e08c9873180.mp4?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No arena is like the other. Each with its own unique era, look and feel, get ready to step into an entirely different world with each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"502\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/228f24f48e4c3f2e0b70514cc88f104a.poster.avif?t=1783685881\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/228f24f48e4c3f2e0b70514cc88f104a.webm?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/228f24f48e4c3f2e0b70514cc88f104a.mp4?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cinematic\u00a0Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become invested in your foe's most crucial moments through a series of well crafted <strong>illustrations,</strong> and a<strong> fully-voiced narrative.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"502\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/29146cbb445a5a61e1f6520df5ceb9f9.poster.avif?t=1783685881\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/29146cbb445a5a61e1f6520df5ceb9f9.webm?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/extras/29146cbb445a5a61e1f6520df5ceb9f9.mp4?t=1783685881\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Crown's Trial is a Souls-Lite Boss Rush where each battle takes place in a different realm. Master tight combat mechanics to defeat legendary heroes inspired from various historical eras like Ancient Rome, Feudal Japan, the Crusades, and many more.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135440/ccc3ddd7f9b0c809aaaa780a3e26a3a6dd0e9c11/header.jpg?t=1783685881", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Boss Rush", "Difficult", "Action-Adventure", "Fantasy", "Souls-like", "3D"], "developers": "Gilded Games", "publishers": "Gilded Games", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4135440", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 May 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://